98
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:54,080
So it's basically internet that has no wires.

99
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:56,600
You don't need to connect your computer to anything.

100
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:59,400
You just log on and use the internet.

101
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:00,400
Alright.

102
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:02,300
So look out for that when you're in a cafe next time.

103
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:03,760
Do they have Wi-Fi?

104
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:04,940
Usually there's a sign on the wall.

105
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:09,800
