107
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,360
Alright.

108
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:18,620
So if you have a watch for example and you can take this watch into a swimming pool or the ocean, it means it's waterproof.

109
00:05:19,100 --> 00:05:20,560
So it resists water.

110
00:05:20,760 --> 00:05:22,540
It won't get damaged if it gets wet.

111
00:05:22,860 --> 00:05:23,100
Great.

112
00:05:23,420 --> 00:05:26,400
So I could say that I have a waterproof jacket.

113
00:05:27,380 --> 00:05:33,060
So that means that when I go in the rain, my clothes don't get wet because they don't go inside the fabric.

114
00:05:33,460 --> 00:05:33,940
Right.

115
00:05:34,020 --> 00:05:37,420
So there are many things waterproof as watches or waterproof cameras.

116
